.EE

.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBpodman(1)\fP, \fBpodman-pull(1)\fP, \fBpodman-login(1)\fP, \fBcontainers-certs.d(5)\fP, \fBcontainers-registries.conf(5)\fP, \fBcontainers-transports(5)\fP

